//@version=6
// =============================================================================
//  Liquidity Pools & Sweeps  —  v2.0  (standalone)
//  Buy-side (BSL) above swing highs, sell-side (SSL) below swing lows.
//  Flags equal-highs/lows (EQH/EQL) and the liquidity grab when price wicks
//  through a pool and closes back. "Talking" status dashboard.
//
//  v2.0 changes vs v1.9 (2026-07-03, "nu da semnale tocmai corecte" + redesign):
//   ═══ LOGICA — 3 fixe de corectitudine a semnalelor ═══
//   FIX #1 (grab FALS pe break-and-retest — cauza principala de semnale gresite):
//     cu "Require close-back" ON, un pool spart CURAT (close DINCOLO de nivel,
//     breakout real) NU era marcat si ramanea ACTIV. Cand pretul revenea mai
//     tarziu de sus prin nivel (retest normal de breakout), conditia
//     high>lvl & close<lvl se indeplinea si indicatorul striga "GRAB -> GO
//     SHORT" pe un simplu retest — semnal INVERS fata de context. Acum:
//     inchiderea dincolo de nivel fara close-back = BREAK -> poolul se
//     INVALIDEAZA pe loc (linie gri punctata + label "break", fara alerta).
//     Un nivel inchis dincolo e BOS/continuare, nu lichiditate de recoltat.
//   FIX #2 (trigger mincinos in fereastra): dupa un grab, "GO LONG/SHORT ACUM"
//     ramanea aprins TOATA fereastra evalBars chiar daca pretul recucerea
//     nivelul imediat (grab esuat) — outcome-ul se judeca abia la finalul
//     ferestrei. Acum: orice inchidere inapoi DINCOLO de nivelul maturat
//     infirma grab-ul PE LOC (CONTINUATION) si triggerul trece pe "STAI".
//   FIX #3 (metrica Edge fade masura gresit): win-ul si excursia se masurau
//     fata de NIVEL, dar intrarea fade-ului e la CLOSE-ul barei de grab —
//     care e DEJA dincolo de nivel prin definitia close-back. Rezultat:
//     "rev" iesea aproape mereu true (bias optimist) si excursia includea
//     gap-ul wick->close pe care nu-l castigi. Acum: totul fata de ENTRY
//     (close-ul barei de grab): win = close dincolo de entry in directia
//     fade la evalBars; med xATR = excursia fata de entry. Verdictul "Last
//     sweep" la fel: REVERSAL OK = fade profitabil vs entry; FARA MISCARE =
//     nici continuare, nici profit.
//   ═══ DASHBOARD — redesign "ink + nisip" (skill frontend-design) ═══
//     Sincron cu suita (AntiFOMO v9.14 / Confluence v1.6 / SMS v6.12 / CODE
//     MACD v2.10 / Command Deck v1.4 / Sniper v6.5 / AGAIG v3.9.5 / Market
//     Health v4.9): surfaces ink zebra #10141b/#151a24, FARA grila interioara
//     (border 0) + chenar subtil #2a3145, titlu pe auriu #d9a95c, verdict +
//     trigger = hero cu bg plin (teal #26a69a long / coral #ef5350 short /
//     amber asteapta / ink+auriu neutru), verde/rosu vechi (#4caf50/#ff5252)
//     -> teal/coral, "fara setup" -> "RABDARE". BSL default pe auriu-nisip
//     #d9a95c (era #f0b429), SSL ramane cyan (identitate per-pool).
//
//  v1.9 changes vs v1.8:
//   - Rand nou in dashboard: "Edge fade" - tracker de expectancy care raspunde
//     scurt daca fade-ul (intrarea INVERS dupa grab) chiar plateste pe activul/TF
//     asta. Inainte se vedea doar outcome-ul ULTIMULUI grab (Last sweep); acum se
//     evalueaza FIECARE grab dintr-o coada, la evalBars bare, si se cumuleaza:
//       wins/total (cate au revenit dincolo de nivel) + win% + mutarea medie in
//       directia fade (xATR). Verdict: FADE OK (win>=55% si med>0) / FADE SLAB
//       (win<=45% sau med<0) / MIXT; sub 5 grab-uri = "putine date". Tooltip
//       explica metrica pe hover. Doar masura - nu schimba semnalele.
//
//  v1.8 changes vs v1.7:
//   - Alerte fara fals-pozitiv: alert() inline trece pe freq_once_per_bar_close.
//     Cu "Require close-back" ON, close-ul era LIVE intrabar -> un close-back de
//     moment putea trage alerta desi la inchiderea barei grab-ul nu mai era valid.
//     Acum trag doar pe bara inchisa (cum recomanda chiar nota din header).
//   - cleanupATR bidirectional: un pool e considerat "departe" cand pretul se duce
//     |xATR| in ORICE directie (inainte doar pe partea de origine -> poolurile rupte
//     curat pe partea opusa, fara close-back, ramaneau active la infinit).
//   - Divizari la atr protejate (atrSafe): pe active flat/ilichide atr putea fi 0 ->
//     bslAtr/sslAtr dadeau inf in loc de na. Acum se degradeaza curat la na.
//
//  v1.7 changes vs v1.6:
//   - Verdict aliniat cu trigger-ul: cat timp un grab e proaspat si neinfirmat
//     (grabLive), randul-verdict arata "GRAB ... LONG/SHORT activ" pe directia
//     grab-ului produs, nu magnetul urmator. Verdict si trigger nu se mai
//     contrazic in ferestrele de dupa un grab.
//
//  v1.6 changes vs v1.5:
//   - Rand TRIGGER nou (sub verdict): raspunsul scurt negru-pe-alb daca intri
//     ACUM sau astepti. "ASTEAPTA GRAB -> LONG/SHORT" (galben) cat timp nu s-a
//     produs grab-ul; "GO LONG/SHORT ACUM" (verde/rosu) cat timp grab-ul e
//     proaspat (in fereastra evalBars); "STAI - continuation" daca a spart.
//     Elimina confuzia "verde = intru acum" - culoarea verdict arata DIRECTIA,
//     trigger-ul arata DACA ai voie sa intri.
//
//  v1.5 changes vs v1.4:
//   - Culoarea randului-verdict = DIRECTIA (verde LONG / rosu SHORT / gri
//     NEUTRU), conventia clasica. Urgenta (IN ZONE / WATCH / NEUTRU) ramane
//     scrisa in text. Inainte culoarea insemna urgenta, ceea ce inducea in
//     eroare (rosu nu insemna short).
//
//  v1.4 changes vs v1.3:
//   - Preset Crypto / Nasdaq / Custom pe parametrii cheie (Swing length,
//     Equal-level tolerance, Setup within). Crypto = mai larg (24/7, volatil),
//     Nasdaq = mai strans (RTH). Custom = inputurile manuale. Presetul activ
//     apare in randul Context al dashboard-ului.
//
//  v1.3 changes vs v1.2:
//   - Dashboard refacut ca VERDICT ACTIONAL, nu lista de valori:
//       rand-verdict mare (IN ZONE / WATCH / NEUTRU) cu directia magnetului
//       (BSL sus / SSL jos) + ce faci dupa grab (LONG/SHORT), urmat de doua
//       scenarii conditionate: A = LONG la SSL, B = SHORT la BSL, cu cel de
//       pe partea magnetului aprins si opusul estompat.
//   - Tolerance + Mode + varsta magnetului comprimate intr-un rand "Context".
//   - Cod mort eliminat (biasTxt/nextLbl/oppLbl/ageTxt). Zero predictie noua:
//       totul derivat din ssCloser / magDist / nSSL / nBSL / outcome sweep.
//
//  v1.2 changes vs v1.1:
//   - Dashboard rebuilt as a liquidity MAP, not a value list:
//       Bias (which side is the magnet), Next magnet vs Opposite with
//       distance in % AND xATR + [EQH]/[EQL] tag, Setup verdict
//       (NEUTRAL / WATCH / IN ZONE), nearest-pool age, sweep outcome
//       (REVERSAL OK / CONTINUATION), liquidity asymmetry, symbol+TF.
//   - Per-pool creation bar tracked (bCB/sCB) -> pool age.
//   - Sweep-outcome mini-tracker: after `lookahead` bars, did price revert?
//
//  Honest notes / trade-offs:
//   - Pivots confirm `Swing length` bars LATE (inherent, not repaint).
//   - Pivots do NOT repaint. With "Require close-back" ON, treat a grab as
//     valid only at bar close -> set alerts to "Once per bar close".
//   - Sweep outcome is a SIMPLE close-vs-level check `lookahead` bars after
//     the grab. It is a sanity read, not a backtest of expectancy.
//   - Verdictul/scenariile NU prezic directia: deriva strict din care pool e
//     mai aproape (magnet) si din logica fade (grab + close-back -> revenire).
//   - Bounded: only `Max active pools per side` tracked; oldest un-swept is
//     dropped when exceeded. Swept lines/labels auto-pruned by max counts.
// =============================================================================

indicator("Liquidity Pools & Sweeps v2.0", overlay = true,
     max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 500)

// ----------------------------- Inputs ----------------------------------------
grpP = "Preset"
preset = input.string("Custom", "Preset", options = ["Crypto", "Nasdaq", "Custom"], group = grpP,
     tooltip = "Crypto = 24/7, volatil (pivoturi/tolerante mai largi). Nasdaq = RTH, mai strans. Custom = folosesti inputurile manuale de mai jos.")

grpD = "Detection"
pivotLenC  = input.int(8, "Swing length (Custom)", minval = 1, maxval = 50, group = grpD,
     tooltip = "Folosit doar pe preset Custom. Bars on each side of a pivot. Larger = fewer, more significant pools. Pivots confirm this many bars late.")
eqTolATRC  = input.float(0.10, "Equal-level tolerance xATR (Custom)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.01, group = grpD,
     tooltip = "Folosit doar pe preset Custom. Two pivots within this xATR(14) are treated as an equal-highs/lows cluster (EQH/EQL).")
maxPools   = input.int(6, "Max active pools per side", minval = 1, maxval = 30, group = grpD,
     tooltip = "Oldest un-swept pool is dropped when exceeded. Keeps the chart clean and the work bounded.")
onlyEqual  = input.bool(false, "Only show equal-level pools", group = grpD,
     tooltip = "If on, a pool is drawn only when it matches a recent pivot within tolerance.")
cleanupATR = input.float(0.0, "Drop pools beyond (xATR, 0=off)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = grpD,
     tooltip = "Optional: remove an active pool when price moves this many xATR away from it. 0 disables.")

grpS = "Sweep / grab"
requireClose = input.bool(true, "Require close-back for sweep", group = grpS,
     tooltip = "On: grab needs the wick to pierce the level AND the bar to close back on the origin side. Off: any wick beyond the level counts.")
evalBars     = input.int(5, "Sweep outcome lookahead (bars)", minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = grpS,
     tooltip = "Bars after a grab to judge REVERSAL vs CONTINUATION (close vs the swept level). Sanity read, not a backtest.")

grpV = "Visuals"
showLabels = input.bool(true,  "Show labels", group = grpV)
extendR    = input.bool(true,  "Extend pools to the right", group = grpV)
// v2.0: default-uri pe paleta "ink + nisip" (raman configurabile)
bslCol     = input.color(#d9a95c, "Buy-side (BSL)", group = grpV)
sslCol     = input.color(#38bdf8, "Sell-side (SSL)", group = grpV)
sweptCol   = input.color(#707887, "Swept", group = grpV)
lblBg      = input.color(color.new(#10141b, 25), "Label background", group = grpV)

grpT = "Dashboard"
showDash = input.bool(true, "Show status dashboard", group = grpT)
dashPos  = input.string("Top Right", "Position", options = ["Top Right", "Top Left", "Bottom Right", "Bottom Left"], group = grpT)
setupATRc = input.float(0.5, "Setup alert within xATR (Custom)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = grpT,
     tooltip = "Folosit doar pe preset Custom. If the nearest pool is closer than this (in xATR), Setup shows WATCH. Inside the equality tolerance it shows IN ZONE.")

// ----------------------------- Preset resolve --------------------------------
// Custom = inputurile manuale; altfel valori potrivite naturii activului.
int   pivotLen = preset == "Crypto" ? 8    : preset == "Nasdaq" ? 10   : pivotLenC
float eqTolATR = preset == "Crypto" ? 0.15 : preset == "Nasdaq" ? 0.08 : eqTolATRC
float setupATR = preset == "Crypto" ? 0.7  : preset == "Nasdaq" ? 0.4  : setupATRc

// ----------------------------- State -----------------------------------------
atr = ta.atr(14)
float atrSafe = atr > 0 ? atr : na   // pe active flat/ilichide atr poate fi 0 -> impuscaturi inf la impartire
tol = atr * eqTolATR

// Active pools (parallel arrays, kept in sync by index)
var array<line>  bL   = array.new<line>()
var array<float> bV   = array.new<float>()
var array<bool>  bE   = array.new<bool>()
var array<label> bLab = array.new<label>()
var array<int>   bCB  = array.new<int>()    // creation bar (for age)

var array<line>  sL   = array.new<line>()
var array<float> sV   = array.new<float>()
var array<bool>  sE   = array.new<bool>()
var array<label> sLab = array.new<label>()
var array<int>   sCB  = array.new<int>()

// Recent-pivot memory for equality
var array<float> memPH = array.new<float>()
var array<float> memPL = array.new<float>()
int memCap = 12

// Last-sweep tracking (for dashboard + outcome)
var int    lastSweepBar     = na
var string lastSweepSide    = ""
var float  lastSweepLvl     = na
var float  lastSweepEntry   = na   // v2.0 FIX #3: entry-ul fade = close-ul barei de grab
var bool   lastSweepDone    = true
var string lastSweepOutcome = "-"

// --- Expectancy tracker fade (v1.9) ---------------------------------------
// Coada de grab-uri in asteptarea evaluarii (fiecare se judeca la evalBars bare),
// + contoarele cumulate. Raspunde la intrebarea: "fade-ul dupa grab CHIAR plateste
// pe activul/TF-ul asta?" - nu doar ultimul grab (ala ramane in randul Last sweep).
var array<int>   pgBar = array.new<int>()    // bara grab-ului
var array<bool>  pgBuy = array.new<bool>()   // true = grab buy-side (BSL/EQH) -> fade SHORT
var array<float> pgEnt = array.new<float>()  // v2.0 FIX #3: entry-ul fade (close la grab)
var array<float> pgAtr = array.new<float>()  // atr la momentul grab-ului (normalizare xATR)
var int   fadeWins = 0     // grab-uri unde pretul a revenit dincolo de nivel (fade a mers)
var int   fadeTot  = 0     // grab-uri evaluate
var float fadeSumX = 0.0   // suma excursiei in directia fade (xATR) -> media = "cat misca" fade-ul

// ----------------------------- Helpers ---------------------------------------
f_pushCap(array<float> arr, float v, int cap) =>
    array.push(arr, v)
    if array.size(arr) > cap
        array.shift(arr)

f_isEqual(array<float> arr, float v, float t) =>
    bool found = false
    if array.size(arr) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(arr) - 1
            if math.abs(array.get(arr, i) - v) <= t
                found := true
    found

// ----------------------------- Pivots ----------------------------------------
float ph = ta.pivothigh(pivotLen, pivotLen)
float pl = ta.pivotlow(pivotLen, pivotLen)
int   pbar = bar_index - pivotLen

// --- New buy-side pool -------------------------------------------------------
if not na(ph)
    bool isEq = f_isEqual(memPH, ph, tol)
    f_pushCap(memPH, ph, memCap)
    if (not onlyEqual) or isEq
        line ln = line.new(pbar, ph, bar_index, ph, xloc = xloc.bar_index,
             color = bslCol, width = isEq ? 2 : 1,
             style = isEq ? line.style_solid : line.style_dashed)
        label lb = na
        if showLabels
            lb := label.new(pbar, ph, isEq ? "EQH" : "BSL", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                 yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_down,
                 color = lblBg, textcolor = bslCol, size = size.tiny)
        array.push(bL, ln)
        array.push(bV, ph)
        array.push(bE, isEq)
        array.push(bLab, lb)
        array.push(bCB, pbar)
        if array.size(bL) > maxPools
            line.delete(array.shift(bL))
            label.delete(array.shift(bLab))
            array.shift(bV)
            array.shift(bE)
            array.shift(bCB)

// --- New sell-side pool ------------------------------------------------------
if not na(pl)
    bool isEq = f_isEqual(memPL, pl, tol)
    f_pushCap(memPL, pl, memCap)
    if (not onlyEqual) or isEq
        line ln = line.new(pbar, pl, bar_index, pl, xloc = xloc.bar_index,
             color = sslCol, width = isEq ? 2 : 1,
             style = isEq ? line.style_solid : line.style_dashed)
        label lb = na
        if showLabels
            lb := label.new(pbar, pl, isEq ? "EQL" : "SSL", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                 yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_up,
                 color = lblBg, textcolor = sslCol, size = size.tiny)
        array.push(sL, ln)
        array.push(sV, pl)
        array.push(sE, isEq)
        array.push(sLab, lb)
        array.push(sCB, pbar)
        if array.size(sL) > maxPools
            line.delete(array.shift(sL))
            label.delete(array.shift(sLab))
            array.shift(sV)
            array.shift(sE)
            array.shift(sCB)

// ----------------------------- Sweeps ----------------------------------------
bool bslSwept   = false
bool sslSwept   = false
bool bslEqSwept = false
bool sslEqSwept = false

// Buy-side: wick above the level, (optionally) close back below = grab
if array.size(bL) > 0
    for i = array.size(bL) - 1 to 0
        float lvl  = array.get(bV, i)
        bool  isEq = array.get(bE, i)
        bool swept = high > lvl and (requireClose ? close < lvl : true)
        // v2.0 FIX #1: inchidere PESTE nivel fara close-back = BREAK curat (BOS),
        // nu grab. Poolul se invalideaza pe loc — altfel ramanea activ si, la
        // revenirea pretului de sus, dadea un "grab" FALS pe un retest de breakout.
        bool broken = requireClose and not swept and close > lvl
        bool stale = cleanupATR > 0 and math.abs(close - lvl) > cleanupATR * atr
        if swept
            line ln = array.get(bL, i)
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index)
            line.set_color(ln, sweptCol)
            line.set_style(ln, line.style_dotted)
            if showLabels
                label.new(bar_index, high, isEq ? "x EQH grab" : "x BSL grab", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_down,
                     color = lblBg, textcolor = sweptCol, size = size.tiny)
            alert((isEq ? "EQH " : "Buy-side ") + "liquidity swept @ " + str.tostring(lvl, format.mintick), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
            bslSwept := true
            bslEqSwept := bslEqSwept or isEq
            lastSweepBar := bar_index
            lastSweepSide := isEq ? "EQH" : "BSL"
            lastSweepLvl := lvl
            lastSweepEntry := close        // v2.0 FIX #3: entry-ul fade = close-ul de grab
            lastSweepDone := false
            lastSweepOutcome := "pending"
            array.push(pgBar, bar_index)   // expectancy: buy-side grab -> fade SHORT
            array.push(pgBuy, true)
            array.push(pgEnt, close)
            array.push(pgAtr, atr)
            array.remove(bL, i)
            array.remove(bV, i)
            array.remove(bE, i)
            array.remove(bLab, i)
            array.remove(bCB, i)
        else if broken
            // v2.0 FIX #1: nivel inchis DINCOLO -> BREAK; marcheaza si scoate poolul
            line lnb = array.get(bL, i)
            line.set_x2(lnb, bar_index)
            line.set_color(lnb, sweptCol)
            line.set_style(lnb, line.style_dotted)
            if showLabels
                label.new(bar_index, lvl, "BSL break", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_down,
                     color = lblBg, textcolor = sweptCol, size = size.tiny)
            array.remove(bL, i)
            array.remove(bV, i)
            array.remove(bE, i)
            array.remove(bLab, i)
            array.remove(bCB, i)
        else if stale
            line.delete(array.get(bL, i))
            label.delete(array.get(bLab, i))
            array.remove(bL, i)
            array.remove(bV, i)
            array.remove(bE, i)
            array.remove(bLab, i)
            array.remove(bCB, i)
        else if extendR
            line.set_x2(array.get(bL, i), bar_index)

// Sell-side: wick below the level, (optionally) close back above = grab
if array.size(sL) > 0
    for i = array.size(sL) - 1 to 0
        float lvl  = array.get(sV, i)
        bool  isEq = array.get(sE, i)
        bool swept = low < lvl and (requireClose ? close > lvl : true)
        // v2.0 FIX #1 (oglinda): inchidere SUB nivel fara close-back = BREAK curat
        bool broken = requireClose and not swept and close < lvl
        bool stale = cleanupATR > 0 and math.abs(close - lvl) > cleanupATR * atr
        if swept
            line ln = array.get(sL, i)
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index)
            line.set_color(ln, sweptCol)
            line.set_style(ln, line.style_dotted)
            if showLabels
                label.new(bar_index, low, isEq ? "x EQL grab" : "x SSL grab", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_up,
                     color = lblBg, textcolor = sweptCol, size = size.tiny)
            alert((isEq ? "EQL " : "Sell-side ") + "liquidity swept @ " + str.tostring(lvl, format.mintick), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
            sslSwept := true
            sslEqSwept := sslEqSwept or isEq
            lastSweepBar := bar_index
            lastSweepSide := isEq ? "EQL" : "SSL"
            lastSweepLvl := lvl
            lastSweepEntry := close        // v2.0 FIX #3: entry-ul fade = close-ul de grab
            lastSweepDone := false
            lastSweepOutcome := "pending"
            array.push(pgBar, bar_index)   // expectancy: sell-side grab -> fade LONG
            array.push(pgBuy, false)
            array.push(pgEnt, close)
            array.push(pgAtr, atr)
            array.remove(sL, i)
            array.remove(sV, i)
            array.remove(sE, i)
            array.remove(sLab, i)
            array.remove(sCB, i)
        else if broken
            // v2.0 FIX #1: nivel inchis DINCOLO -> BREAK; marcheaza si scoate poolul
            line lnb = array.get(sL, i)
            line.set_x2(lnb, bar_index)
            line.set_color(lnb, sweptCol)
            line.set_style(lnb, line.style_dotted)
            if showLabels
                label.new(bar_index, lvl, "SSL break", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_up,
                     color = lblBg, textcolor = sweptCol, size = size.tiny)
            array.remove(sL, i)
            array.remove(sV, i)
            array.remove(sE, i)
            array.remove(sLab, i)
            array.remove(sCB, i)
        else if stale
            line.delete(array.get(sL, i))
            label.delete(array.get(sLab, i))
            array.remove(sL, i)
            array.remove(sV, i)
            array.remove(sE, i)
            array.remove(sLab, i)
            array.remove(sCB, i)
        else if extendR
            line.set_x2(array.get(sL, i), bar_index)

// ----------------------------- Sweep-outcome tracker -------------------------
// v2.0 FIX #2: invalidare IMEDIATA — orice inchidere inapoi DINCOLO de nivelul
// maturat, inainte de evalBars, infirma grab-ul PE LOC (CONTINUATION). Triggerul
// GO nu mai ramane aprins pe un grab deja esuat pana la finalul ferestrei.
if not lastSweepDone and not na(lastSweepBar) and bar_index > lastSweepBar
    bool buySide0 = lastSweepSide == "BSL" or lastSweepSide == "EQH"
    if buySide0 ? close > lastSweepLvl : close < lastSweepLvl
        lastSweepOutcome := "CONTINUATION"
        lastSweepDone := true
// v2.0 FIX #3: verdictul final se judeca fata de ENTRY (close-ul barei de grab),
// nu fata de nivel — fata de nivel aproape orice grab parea "REVERSAL OK" pentru
// ca close-back-ul e deja dincolo de nivel prin definitie.
if not lastSweepDone and not na(lastSweepBar) and (bar_index - lastSweepBar) >= evalBars
    bool buySide = lastSweepSide == "BSL" or lastSweepSide == "EQH"
    bool paid = not na(lastSweepEntry) and (buySide ? close < lastSweepEntry : close > lastSweepEntry)
    lastSweepOutcome := paid ? "REVERSAL OK" : "FARA MISCARE"
    lastSweepDone := true

// --- Expectancy tracker (v1.9, corectat v2.0): evalueaza FIECARE grab din coada ---
// v2.0 FIX #3: win-ul si excursia se masoara fata de ENTRY (close-ul barei de grab),
// NU fata de nivel. Entry-ul fade e la close, care e deja dincolo de nivel prin
// close-back -> masurat fata de nivel, "rev" iesea aproape mereu true (bias optimist)
// si excursia includea gap-ul wick->close pe care nu-l castigi. Un grab recucerit
// (close dincolo de nivel) iese acum natural pe pierdere vs entry.
if array.size(pgBar) > 0
    while array.size(pgBar) > 0 and (bar_index - array.get(pgBar, 0)) >= evalBars
        bool  buyG = array.get(pgBuy, 0)
        float entG = array.get(pgEnt, 0)
        float atrG = array.get(pgAtr, 0)
        float atrN = atrG > 0 ? atrG : (atr > 0 ? atr : na)
        bool  rev  = buyG ? close < entG : close > entG      // fade SHORT (buy grab) / fade LONG (sell grab), vs ENTRY
        float exc  = na(atrN) ? na : (buyG ? (entG - close) : (close - entG)) / atrN
        fadeTot  += 1
        fadeWins += rev ? 1 : 0
        fadeSumX += na(exc) ? 0.0 : exc
        array.shift(pgBar)
        array.shift(pgBuy)
        array.shift(pgEnt)
        array.shift(pgAtr)

// ----------------------------- Dashboard -------------------------------------
f_dashPos(_p) =>
    _p == "Top Left" ? position.top_left : _p == "Bottom Right" ? position.bottom_right : _p == "Bottom Left" ? position.bottom_left : position.top_right

// v2.0: fara grila interioara (border 0), chenar exterior subtil, surface ink
var table dash = table.new(f_dashPos(dashPos), 2, 10, border_width = 0, frame_color = color.new(#2a3145, 0), frame_width = 1)

f_cell(_t, _c, _r, _txt, _tc) =>
    table.cell(_t, _c, _r, _txt, text_color = _tc, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = _r % 2 == 0 ? color.new(#10141b, 0) : color.new(#151a24, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)

if showDash and barstate.islast
    // ---- nearest pools (capture flag + creation bar IN-LOOP, no later array.get on a maybe-invalid index) ----
    float nBSL   = na
    bool  nBSLeq = false
    int   nBSLcb = na
    if array.size(bV) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(bV) - 1
            float v = array.get(bV, i)
            if v >= close and (na(nBSL) or v < nBSL)
                nBSL   := v
                nBSLeq := array.get(bE, i)
                nBSLcb := array.get(bCB, i)
    float nSSL   = na
    bool  nSSLeq = false
    int   nSSLcb = na
    if array.size(sV) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(sV) - 1
            float v = array.get(sV, i)
            if v <= close and (na(nSSL) or v > nSSL)
                nSSL   := v
                nSSLeq := array.get(sE, i)
                nSSLcb := array.get(sCB, i)

    float bslAtr = na(nBSL) ? na : (nBSL - close) / atrSafe
    float sslAtr = na(nSSL) ? na : (close - nSSL) / atrSafe
    string bslLine = na(nBSL) ? "-" : str.tostring(nBSL, format.mintick) + "  +" + str.tostring((nBSL - close) / close * 100, "#.##") + "% / " + str.tostring(bslAtr, "#.##") + "xATR" + (nBSLeq ? "  [EQH]" : "")
    string sslLine = na(nSSL) ? "-" : str.tostring(nSSL, format.mintick) + "  -" + str.tostring((close - nSSL) / close * 100, "#.##") + "% / " + str.tostring(sslAtr, "#.##") + "xATR" + (nSSLeq ? "  [EQL]" : "")

    // which side is the magnet (closer in xATR)?
    bool ssCloser = not na(sslAtr) and (na(bslAtr) or sslAtr <= bslAtr)
    bool hasMag   = not na(bslAtr) or not na(sslAtr)
    float magDist = not hasMag ? na : ssCloser ? sslAtr : bslAtr

    // ---- setup verdict (folosit de rand-verdict si de randul Setup) ----
    string setupTxt = "NEUTRAL"
    color  setupCol = color.new(#5c6370, 0)
    if not na(magDist)
        if magDist <= eqTolATR
            setupTxt := "IN ZONE - grab posibil"
            setupCol := #f0554e
        else if magDist <= setupATR
            setupTxt := "WATCH - " + str.tostring(magDist, "#.##") + "xATR"
            setupCol := #f2a93b
        else
            setupTxt := "NEUTRAL - " + str.tostring(magDist, "#.##") + "xATR"
            setupCol := color.new(#5c6370, 0)

    // ---- grab proaspat? (folosit de verdict SI de trigger) ----
    bool   freshGrab = not na(lastSweepBar) and (bar_index - lastSweepBar) <= evalBars
    bool   grabLong  = lastSweepSide == "SSL" or lastSweepSide == "EQL"
    bool   grabLive  = freshGrab and lastSweepOutcome != "CONTINUATION"

    // ---- verdict actional: magnet jos (SSL) -> LONG dupa grab, magnet sus (BSL) -> SHORT
    bool   hasDir   = hasMag and not na(magDist)
    string magName  = ssCloser ? "SSL" : "BSL"
    string magArr   = ssCloser ? "▼" : "▲"
    float  magLvl   = ssCloser ? nSSL : nBSL
    string tradeDir = ssCloser ? "LONG" : "SHORT"
    string vState   = not na(magDist) and magDist <= eqTolATR ? "IN ZONE" : not na(magDist) and magDist <= setupATR ? "WATCH" : "NEUTRU"
    // v2.0 HERO: culoare = DIRECTIA (teal long / coral short / ink+auriu neutru)
    color  vTxt  = color.new(#d9a95c, 0)
    color  vCol  = color.new(#1a2130, 0)
    string vMain = "NEUTRU\nfara pooluri active"
    string vSide = "-"
    if grabLive
        // grab proaspat neinfirmat -> verdictul se aliniaza cu trigger-ul (directia grab-ului)
        vCol  := grabLong ? #26a69a : #ef5350
        vTxt  := grabLong ? color.new(#052019, 0) : color.new(#ffffff, 0)
        vMain := "GRAB  " + (grabLong ? "▼ " : "▲ ") + lastSweepSide + "\n" + (grabLong ? "LONG activ" : "SHORT activ")
        vSide := na(lastSweepLvl) ? "-" : "@" + str.tostring(lastSweepLvl, format.mintick) + "\n" + str.tostring(bar_index - lastSweepBar) + "b"
    else if hasDir
        vCol  := tradeDir == "LONG" ? #26a69a : #ef5350
        vTxt  := tradeDir == "LONG" ? color.new(#052019, 0) : color.new(#ffffff, 0)
        vMain := vState + "  " + magArr + " " + magName + "\n" + (vState == "IN ZONE" ? "grab acum -> " : "asteapta grab -> ") + tradeDir
        vSide := na(magLvl) ? "-" : "@" + str.tostring(magLvl, format.mintick) + "\n" + str.tostring(magDist, "#.##") + "xATR"

    // ---- doua scenarii conditionate; cel de pe partea magnetului e aprins, opusul estompat
    bool   aActive = ssCloser
    color  dimCol  = color.new(#5c6370, 0)
    color  aTxt    = na(nSSL) ? dimCol : aActive ? sslCol : dimCol
    color  bTxt    = na(nBSL) ? dimCol : (not aActive) ? bslCol : dimCol
    string aHead   = (aActive ? "► " : "  ") + "LONG (A)"
    string bHead   = ((not aActive) ? "► " : "  ") + "SHORT (B)"
    string aVal    = na(nSSL) ? "fara SSL pool" : sslLine + "\ngrab+close-back -> LONG"
    string bVal    = na(nBSL) ? "fara BSL pool" : bslLine + "\ngrab+close-back -> SHORT"

    // ---- counts / asymmetry ----
    int nb = array.size(bV)
    int ns = array.size(sV)
    string asymTxt = "BSL " + str.tostring(nb) + " / SSL " + str.tostring(ns) + (nb == ns ? "  (echilibrat)" : nb > ns ? "  (mai mult sus)" : "  (mai mult jos)")

    // ---- nearest-pool age (magnet side) — captured creation bar, no array.get ----
    int magAge = ssCloser ? (na(nSSLcb) ? na : bar_index - nSSLcb) : (na(nBSLcb) ? na : bar_index - nBSLcb)

    // ---- last sweep + outcome ----
    color  swpCol = lastSweepOutcome == "REVERSAL OK" ? #2ec4a6 : lastSweepOutcome == "CONTINUATION" ? #f0554e : sweptCol
    string swpTxt = na(lastSweepBar) ? "-" : lastSweepSide + " grab | " + str.tostring(bar_index - lastSweepBar) + "b | " + lastSweepOutcome

    // ---- EDGE FADE (v1.9): verdict scurt = fade-ul plateste pe activul/TF asta? ----
    // wins/total grab-uri care au revenit dincolo de nivel + mutarea medie in directia fade (xATR).
    // 100.0 * int / int = float (evita diviziunea intreaga Pine). Sub 5 grab-uri = prea putine date.
    string edgeTxt = "-"
    color  edgeCol = sweptCol
    if fadeTot < 5
        edgeTxt := "putine date (" + str.tostring(fadeTot) + " grab)"
        edgeCol := color.new(#5c6370, 0)
    else
        float wr   = 100.0 * fadeWins / fadeTot
        float avgX = fadeSumX / fadeTot
        string verdict = (wr >= 55 and avgX > 0) ? "FADE OK" : (wr <= 45 or avgX < 0) ? "FADE SLAB" : "MIXT"
        edgeCol := verdict == "FADE OK" ? #2ec4a6 : verdict == "FADE SLAB" ? #f0554e : color.new(#5c6370, 0)
        edgeTxt := verdict + "  " + str.tostring(fadeWins) + "/" + str.tostring(fadeTot) + " (" + str.tostring(wr, "#") + "%)  med " + (avgX >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(avgX, "#.##") + "xATR"

    // ---- TRIGGER: pot intra ACUM sau inca astept? (raspunsul scurt, negru pe alb) ----
    // Foloseste freshGrab/grabLong calculate mai sus. Cu close-back ON, grab-ul inregistrat
    // are deja inchidere inapoi peste nivel => entry-ul fade e valid pe el.
    // v2.0: paleta casei — GO teal/coral, asteapta amber, restul ink+auriu (RABDARE)
    string trigTxt   = "RABDARE - fara setup"
    color  trigBg    = color.new(#1a2130, 0)
    color  trigFg    = color.new(#d9a95c, 0)
    if freshGrab and lastSweepOutcome == "CONTINUATION"
        trigTxt := "STAI - continuation (a spart, nu intra)"
        trigBg  := color.new(#1a2130, 0)
        trigFg  := color.new(#f0554e, 0)
    else if freshGrab
        trigTxt := (grabLong ? "GO LONG ACUM" : "GO SHORT ACUM") + " - grab " + (requireClose ? "+ close-back" : "(doar wick!)")
        trigBg  := grabLong ? #26a69a : #ef5350
        trigFg  := grabLong ? color.new(#052019, 0) : color.new(#ffffff, 0)
    else if hasDir
        trigTxt := "ASTEAPTA GRAB -> apoi " + tradeDir
        trigBg  := #f2a93b
        trigFg  := #231600

    // ---- context comprimat: tolerance + mode + varsta magnetului ----
    string ctxTxt = preset + " | tol " + str.tostring(eqTolATR, "#.##") + "xATR | " + (requireClose ? "close-back" : "wick-only") + (onlyEqual ? " | EQ-only" : "") + (na(magAge) ? "" : " | " + str.tostring(magAge) + "b")

    // ---- render (v2.0: titlu pe accent nisip, header ink) ----
    table.cell(dash, 0, 0, "LIQUIDITY MAP v2.0", text_color = color.new(#d9a95c, 0), text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = color.new(#1b2130, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 0, syminfo.ticker + "  " + timeframe.period, text_color = color.new(#707887, 0), text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#1b2130, 0), text_halign = text.align_right)

    table.cell(dash, 0, 1, vMain, text_color = vTxt, text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = vCol, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 1, vSide, text_color = vTxt, text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = vCol, text_halign = text.align_right)

    // TRIGGER — raspunsul scurt: intri ACUM sau astepti
    table.cell(dash, 0, 2, trigTxt, text_color = trigFg, text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = trigBg, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 2, freshGrab ? str.tostring(bar_index - lastSweepBar) + "b" : "-", text_color = trigFg, text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = trigBg, text_halign = text.align_right)

    table.cell(dash, 0, 3, aHead, text_color = aTxt, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#151a24, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 3, aVal,  text_color = aTxt, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#151a24, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 0, 4, bHead, text_color = bTxt, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#10141b, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 4, bVal,  text_color = bTxt, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#10141b, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)

    f_cell(dash, 0, 5, "Setup",      color.new(#707887, 0))
    f_cell(dash, 1, 5, setupTxt,     setupCol)
    f_cell(dash, 0, 6, "Pools",      color.new(#707887, 0))
    f_cell(dash, 1, 6, asymTxt,      color.new(#d8dce5, 0))
    f_cell(dash, 0, 7, "Last sweep", color.new(#707887, 0))
    f_cell(dash, 1, 7, swpTxt,       swpCol)
    f_cell(dash, 0, 8, "Context",    color.new(#707887, 0))
    f_cell(dash, 1, 8, ctxTxt,       color.new(#d8dce5, 0))
    // EDGE FADE — verdict scurt: merita sa faci fade pe grab-uri pe activul/TF asta?
    table.cell(dash, 0, 9, "Edge fade", text_color = color.new(#707887, 0), text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#151a24, 0), text_halign = text.align_left,
         tooltip = "Fade = intri INVERS dupa grab (grab buy-side -> SHORT, sell-side -> LONG).\nv2.0: masurat fata de ENTRY (close-ul barei de grab), nu fata de nivel.\nwins/total = de cate ori close-ul era dincolo de entry in directia fade dupa " + str.tostring(evalBars) + " bare.\nmed xATR = excursia medie fata de entry, in directia fade.\nFADE OK = win>=55% SI med>0 | FADE SLAB = win<=45% SAU med<0 | sub 5 grab-uri = prea putine date.")
    table.cell(dash, 1, 9, edgeTxt, text_color = edgeCol, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(#151a24, 0), text_halign = text.align_left)

// ----------------------------- Alert conditions ------------------------------
alertcondition(bslSwept,   "Buy-side liquidity swept",  "BSL grab")
alertcondition(sslSwept,   "Sell-side liquidity swept", "SSL grab")
alertcondition(bslEqSwept, "EQH liquidity swept",       "EQH grab (double-top sweep)")
alertcondition(sslEqSwept, "EQL liquidity swept",       "EQL grab (double-bottom sweep)")
